{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KAZ</strong> is the <strong>ultimate</strong> test of <strong>speed</strong>, <strong>precision</strong>, and raw <strong>skill</strong>. Dive into an electrifying <strong>roguelike</strong> built entirely around <strong>lightning-fast</strong> finger dexterity. Dash and react at blistering pace as you race to dominate the <strong>leaderboards</strong>. Every session delivers fresh challenges, new gear to <strong>unlock</strong>, and endless chances to showcase your <strong>mastery</strong>.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/kaz_collect_alpha.gif?t=1747389413\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dash faster, live longer.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Frame-Reactive Controls</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The engine accepts more than 20 inputs per second\u2014can you keep up?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Instant Fun, No Filler</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No clumsy story, no boring dialogue, and no f****** tutorial. <strong>Boot, play, grind.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meta Progression</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock dozens of items, challenges, music, and full-game visual skins.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break the Game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge the perfect build and rewrite the rules</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Online &amp; Friends Leaderboards</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily, weekly, and monthly ladders\u2014prove your worth and shine in the top three.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Advanced statistics</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inputs per second, reaction time, and more. Track performance, sharpen reflexes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Ultimate Dexterity Trainer</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Easy to pick up, brutally hard to master. Think fast, act faster\u2014an endless skill ceiling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Immediate - Minimalist - Intense - Addictive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash through a tight arena using <strong>only four keys</strong>, crushing enemies to rack up points before a ruthless <strong>20-second</strong> fuse burns out. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive wave after wave</strong>, strategically unlocking <strong>powerful items</strong> and <strong>game-breaking</strong> upgrades. Customize each run with unique themes, turning every victory into a stylish flex. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">KAZ is built for <strong>competition</strong>\u2014push your abilities to the limit and climb the ranks where only the sharpest reflexes reign supreme.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Choose your aesthetic </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock <strong>hand-crafted themes</strong>, swap the entire look on the fly, and immerse yourself in guest-<strong>artist's universes</strong>\u2014more than 30 themes to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/extras/kaz_logos.gif?t=1747389413\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Do you have what it takes to master the frenzy and become the <strong>ultimate KAZ champion</strong>? Prepare your fingers\u2014it's time to prove it!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633760?t=1747389413","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633760?t=1747389413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633760/7547c4de9698e